# Review regression (U22, B6). Before: the Tab menu over a confirm box said "Enter 确认 /
# ` 取消" while the box said "Enter 开始 · ` 返回修改" (D6: ` goes back to the editor), two
# names for one key; the meeting start box's menu said "Enter 确认" under "Enter 开始".
# Now: the rows say what the box says: Enter 开始 / 存为排队 / 关闭, ` 返回修改 with the draft
# behind the box, else 取消 (a queue item's, opened from the board); the start box Enter 开始,
# ` 取消, Opt+L 取消并锁屏.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
press opt+1
press opt+s
type fix the refund webhook
press enter
wait 500
shot spawn  the spawn confirm: Enter 开始 · ` 返回修改
press tab
wait 400
shot spawn-menu  its Tab menu: Enter 开始, ` 返回修改, Fn+` 返回修改
press down
wait 200
press enter
wait 400
shot back  the ` row: back in the editor, the text kept
press `
wait 500
press enter
wait 300
press opt+h
wait 300
press opt+r
wait 200
press tab
wait 400
shot start-menu  the meeting start box's menu: Enter 开始, ` 取消, Opt+L 取消并锁屏
press tab
wait 300
press `
wait 300
usb off
wait 1500
press opt+1
press opt+s
type tidy the logs
press enter
wait 500
shot queued  offline: 离线：只存到 Mac 队列, Enter 存为排队 · ` 返回修改
press tab
wait 400
shot queued-menu  its Tab menu: Enter 存为排队, ` 返回修改, Fn+` 返回修改
